  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://nyako.gay/assets/veindigging.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>VeinDigging</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><strong>VeinDigging</strong>&nbsp;</strong>是一个允许玩家进行“矿脉挖掘”的模组——就像 VeinMiner 一样！与其他 VeinMiner 类模组不同，本模组<strong>在客户端是可选安装的。</strong>这意味着<strong>服务器上的任何人都可以通过潜行来进行矿脉挖掘</strong>，但安装了本模组的玩家可以<strong>使用矿脉挖掘快捷键</strong>！此外，当工具即将损坏时，您会自动停止矿脉挖掘。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>服务器管理员注意：</strong></p>\n<p>提供了白名单和黑名单标签：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>veindigging:bind_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:bind_whitelist</li>\n<li>veindigging:shift_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:shift_whitelist</li>\n<li>veindigging:global_blacklist</li>\n<li>veindigging:global_whitelist</li>\n</ul>\n<p>默认开启的唯一白名单是潜行白名单，其中包含<strong>原木、树叶、矿石和荧光石</strong>。这意味着潜行时不会意外挖掘到不想挖掘的东西。建议不要关闭潜行白名单。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/NyakoFox/VeinDigging/\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available on GitHub\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/veindigging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available on CurseForge\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fveindigging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available on Modrinth\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/fabric_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available for Fabric\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/supported/quilt_vector.svg\" alt=\"Available for Quilt\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/unsupported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"Won&#x27;t support Forge\"><br><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Requires Fabric API\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/cloth-config-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"Requires Cloth Config API\"></a></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://patreon.com/nyakofox\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Support us on Ko-fi\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"Support us on Patreon\" width=\"180\" height=\"56\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">支持者将提前获得我的模组发布版本，并在某些模组中享有特殊奖励。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>作为一名无法胜任常规工作的独立开发者，任何帮助都将不胜感激。🩷&nbsp;</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
